      </maml:description>
      <command:verb>Set</command:verb>
      <command:noun>KeepAChangelogManifestReleaseNotes</command:noun>
    </command:details>
    <maml:description>
      <maml:para>Updates the `PrivateData.PSData.ReleaseNotes` value in a PowerShell module manifest.
When `PrivateData`, `PSData`, or `ReleaseNotes` is missing, the command adds the missing path.

The command preserves comments and empty lines outside the edited range.
It also preserves property order and other text.
It also preserves the manifest encoding, byte order mark, and line endings.
Before writing the file, the command checks the updated manifest syntax and release notes value.</maml:para>
    </maml:description>
